# AC-1 — Media schema and catalog boundary

Commands:
```
backend/hotel-api ./mvnw.cmd -B verify
```

Verified:
- `db/migration/media/V8__create_media_assets.sql` creates only `media.media_assets` and `media.media_variants`.
- `V9__add_media_processing_lease.sql` adds only `media.media_assets.processing_lease_id`.
- `V10__create_public_cleanup_tasks.sql` creates only `media.media_public_cleanup_tasks` plus its unique key, attempts/created/last_attempt columns, created_at index and `app` grants.
