- JPA entities use `@Table(schema = "media")`; no `double`/`float`.
- `media` depends on `catalog` only through `com.hotel.catalog.api.RoomTypeLookup`.
- `HotelApiModularityTest` and `DatabaseSchemaAndRoleSeparationIT` passed.
- `MediaIT` verifies unique room order, single published cover, invalid status/alt text, UUID/foreign-key behavior and inactive room type rejection.

